# This repository is TEXT ONLY. The .txt files are the master copies.
#
# Binaries do not belong in git history: PDFs are build products (make-pdf.sh
# regenerates them from the .txt), and page scans belong on archive.org and in
# Drive, not here. A repo that stays text-only stays small, diffable, and
# readable on any device forever.
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.heic
*.tif
*.tiff
*.zip
*.epub
*.mobi
*.docx
*.odt

# Scratch
.DS_Store
*~
